 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_40cbf5127a4ff98e3006",
   "sourceHash": "40cbf5127a4ff98e300697e77ec05ae6ceba3890f2bac83216dc6c3d59e36a1f",
   "text": "18至70岁年龄段的任何人都可以寻求或经医生建议接受潘查卡玛疗程。潘查卡玛对戒烟及其他戒瘾计划也有帮助，因为它能清除体内多余毒素，从而抑制对成瘾物质的渴求。体内瓦塔（Vata）、皮塔和卡法的失衡同样需要潘查卡玛。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_210a058e6a8ae6b64f68",
   "sourceHash": "210a058e6a8ae6b64f68a18b9b1a94fca0449dfa12aeb2251e57b7aae4b9abe5",
   "text": "潘查卡玛能否让健康问题立即得到缓解？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1fc15ae7460187da69d5",
   "sourceHash": "1fc15ae7460187da69d55b038f1b457c349a5edbb190faa853cc149b9564ebf6",
   "text": "通常不能！潘查卡玛帮助身体排出毒素，效果会逐渐显现；不过，人们会感到身体轻盈，肌肉僵硬也有所缓解。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e89f05291eead854c499",
   "sourceHash": "e89f05291eead854c4996e02612ce6c123ede6067687d51bd287826db82ec81b",
   "text": "潘查卡玛治疗期间及之后，我的饮食会如何安排？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d31b447041868ffbfa03",
   "sourceHash": "d31b447041868ffbfa0377a6616698f57eb683d64ca457ee9924d4e87d7d46ad",
   "text": "潘查卡玛治疗期间会安排清淡的素食。疗程结束后，将根据个人的pravrrati（倾向）安排特定的饮食。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b3a052a2690831afd618",
   "sourceHash": "b3a052a2690831afd6187388655dd4a8a66097f7f0dc36443f12b3007ac9bc0b",
   "text": "潘查卡玛疗法只适用于患病人士吗？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7391688b4157e2747e03",
   "sourceHash": "7391688b4157e2747e030931acd9ac17b0530f1559d14343bd874b581fda126a",
   "text": "不是。潘查卡玛疗法对健康人士同样有益，可促进健康、预防疾病。它有助于排出因季节变化而积聚的多夏（doshas）。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ac3258fc72c005e0380d",
   "sourceHash": "ac3258fc72c005e0380d6f1778154f4f074d1c2c5961e34f810d11305ff85dfc",
   "text": "感受美好，融入生活",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9e79689d4c0579cfdf77",
   "sourceHash": "9e79689d4c0579cfdf77884388ed2ac1f91a5d58b3dd1a0242adb2a2569ad356",
   "text": "美好回忆",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
